# Supabase CLI scratch state. `supabase functions deploy` and `supabase link`
# write the linked project ref and a CLI version stamp here. It is per-machine
# state, not repository content, and committing it makes every developer's
# checkout fight over whose project the CLI last talked to.
supabase/.temp/
